---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 15, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="The privacy policy for NyankoTools, covering how we handle personal information and our use of analytics and advertising services and cookies."
>
  <h1 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
    Last updated: {lastUpdated}
  </p>

  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">
    <p>
      NyankoTools (the "Site") has established this Privacy Policy to explain
      how it handles user information, including personal information, so that
      users can use the Site with confidence.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">1. Operator Information</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is operated by an individual. See the
        <a
          href="/en/about/"
          class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300"
        >
          About page
        </a>
        for more details. For inquiries regarding this policy, please contact us
        using the information in Section 9 ("Contact") below.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        2. Our Basic Policy (How Tools Process Data)
      </h2>
      <p>
        Every tool offered on the Site runs entirely as client-side processing
        within your browser. Data you enter — for text conversion, formatting,
        calculations, and the like — is never sent to the Site's servers. Your
        input is processed only within your own browser and is never stored or
        transmitted externally.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">3. Access Logs</h2>
      <p>
        The Site's hosting provider (Cloudflare) may automatically record access
        logs — such as IP address, browser type, referrer URL, and access
        timestamps — as part of its standard functionality. This information is
        used solely for security and maintenance purposes, such as preventing
        unauthorized access and keeping the Site running stably, and is not used
        to identify individuals.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        4. Analytics and Advertising Services
      </h2>
      <p class="mb-2">
        The Site does not currently use any analytics or advertising services.
        In the future, however, we may use third-party services such as Google
        Analytics or Google AdSense to improve the Site and support its
        continued operation.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-2">
        These services may use cookies to collect traffic data. Data collected
        through cookies is anonymous and does not identify you personally. You
        can opt out of this data collection by disabling cookies in your
        browser; please refer to your browser's help documentation for
        instructions.
      </p>
      <p>
        For Google Analytics' terms of service and privacy policy, please refer
        to Google's official website. Third-party vendors, including Google, may
        also use cookies to serve ads based on a user's visits to the Site and
        other sites. You can opt out of personalized advertising through
        Google's Ads Settings page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">5. About Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Cookies are small data files that a website sends to your browser and
        that are stored on your device. The Site may use cookies if and when the
        analytics or advertising services described above are introduced. You
        can refuse cookies or delete cookies already stored through your browser
        settings. Note that disabling cookies may cause some features of the
        Site to stop working correctly.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        6. Disclosure of Personal Information to Third Parties
      </h2>
      <p>
        The Site will not disclose any information it collects to third parties
        without the individual's consent, except in the following cases:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
        <li>When disclosure is required by law</li>
        <li>
          When disclosure is necessary to protect a person's life, body, or
          property, and obtaining consent is difficult
        </li>
        <li>
          When cooperation with a national or local government agency is
          necessary for it to carry out duties prescribed by law
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        7. Rights Regarding Personal Information Protection
      </h2>
      <p>
        If you reside in a jurisdiction where data protection laws such as the
        EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) or the California Consumer
        Privacy Act (CCPA) apply, you have the right to request disclosure,
        correction, or deletion of information the Site holds about you. To make
        such a request, please contact us using the information in Section 9
        ("Contact") below.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The Site does not knowingly collect personal information from minors,
        including children under the age of 13.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries regarding this policy, please contact us at the email
        address below.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm">nyankotools@gmail.com</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        10. Changes to This Privacy Policy
      </h2>
      <p>
        The Site may change the contents of this policy without notice in
        response to changes in law or in the services it offers. Any revised
        privacy policy takes effect as soon as it is posted on this page. We
        will announce material changes on this page.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
